(7448561, 1178574, 112739, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most bizzare images I have seen on DPC. My highest score for this month. It brings on such an "out of place" and foreign feeling. But the upward facing palms leads me to think this being is asking for forgiveness from an unseen entity or power. Very nice.</td>', 'This is one of the most bizzare images I have seen on DPC. My highest score for this month. It brings on such an "out of place" and foreign feeling. But the upward facing palms leads me to think this being is asking for forgiveness from an unseen entity or power. Very nice.', '2016-04-07 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448562, 1178305, 112739, '<td valign="top">I love the sky but the FG is showing up too much because it''s full of artifacts and noise. Really takes away from the utterly fantastic work you did on the sky. 8</td>', 'I love the sky but the FG is showing up too much because it''s full of artifacts and noise. Really takes away from the utterly fantastic work you did on the sky. 8', '2016-04-07 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448563, 1177708, 112739, '<td valign="top">Bumping, nice light and detail throughout the image. The coastline is very dramatic on it''s own but then the waterfall is there, so I don''t whether is helping the comp. A lot going on in the image and it''s hard to decide what to include and what to leave out, but I think you did good with what was in front of you.</td>', 'Bumping, nice light and detail throughout the image. The coastline is very dramatic on it''s own but then the waterfall is there, so I don''t whether is helping the comp. A lot going on in the image and it''s hard to decide what to include and what to leave out, but I think you did good with what was in front of you.', '2016-04-07 13:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448564, 1178569, 112739, '<td valign="top">Can''t put my finger on why I like this image, I just do.</td>', 'Can''t put my finger on why I like this image, I just do.', '2016-04-07 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448565, 1177605, 112739, '<td valign="top">Without the feline in the image, I would have voted this a 4 for the overpowering colors and overcooking and blowout area''s. But the cat saves the day.</td>', 'Without the feline in the image, I would have voted this a 4 for the overpowering colors and overcooking and blowout area''s. But the cat saves the day.', '2016-04-07 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
