(7448644, 1178586, 69838, '<td valign="top">I see some chromatic aberrations on that tower.  If corrected, I think the image would improve with more saturation or just black and white.  Also, the sky is pretty hot.  Bracketing and creating an HDR may have also helped. You should download NIK Collection if you don''t already have it.  It''s now FREE!</td>', 'I see some chromatic aberrations on that tower.  If corrected, I think the image would improve with more saturation or just black and white.  Also, the sky is pretty hot.  Bracketing and creating an HDR may have also helped. You should download NIK Collection if you don''t already have it.  It''s now FREE!', '2016-04-07 19:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448645, 1177916, 69838, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2016-04-07 19:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448646, 1178205, 69838, '<td valign="top">I think the aperture is opened just a bit to much.  Maybe stopped down one whole step with the aperture to enable more DoF.</td>', 'I think the aperture is opened just a bit to much.  Maybe stopped down one whole step with the aperture to enable more DoF.', '2016-04-07 19:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448647, 1178162, 69838, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp great shadow detail! The blown out window does not distract me. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice and sharp great shadow detail! The blown out window does not distract me. Nice job.', '2016-04-07 19:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448648, 1178486, 69838, '<td valign="top">I love the detail throughout the image.  Was this an exercise of focus stacking?  However, portions of this image appear flat.  I''m not quite sure what could be done to improve this.</td>', 'I love the detail throughout the image.  Was this an exercise of focus stacking?  However, portions of this image appear flat.  I''m not quite sure what could be done to improve this.', '2016-04-07 19:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7448649, 1177891, 69838, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. You must have been in a very very tall building to capture this. ;-)</td>', 'An interesting shot. You must have been in a very very tall building to capture this. ;-)', '2016-04-07 19:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
